      "id": "claim_11518ca27f6e421f9318bd69b8fccf46",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher.fetch validates the target URL via FeedUrlValidator.validate before issuing any HTTP request, so both the subscribe path (FeedService.subscribe) and the recurring poll path (FeedPollingService.pollFeed) share the same SSRF guard because they both go through the single FeedFetcher.fetch entry point.",
