    {
      "id": "claim_e0b0c10e303b43708bb69296bcfd4eac",
      "statement": "FeedUrlValidator documents accepted limitations for its single-user LAN deployment: it does not pin the validated connection to the checked IP address (so DNS rebinding between validation and actual connect can bypass the guard), and it does not re-validate redirect targets per hop.",
