    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c28d934623754bf9a19c00c620519de8",
      "statement": "FeedFetcher bounds a fetched feed body to DEFAULT_MAX_FEED_BYTES (10 MiB) by reading at most that many bytes plus one; exceeding the cap throws FeedFetchException, which GlobalExceptionHandler maps to HTTP 422, preventing an oversized or unbounded streaming response from exhausting heap.",
