    {
      "id": "claim_3c462aa75258447aab0481956d62411e",
      "statement": "FeedPollingScheduler.computeEffectiveInterval clamps the backoff exponent to 30 and computes the interval multiplier using long arithmetic before capping at maxIntervalMinutes, specifically to prevent the doubling from overflowing into a negative Duration (which would make scheduleAtFixedRate throw and crash startup) for feeds with very high error counts.",
